## Notes

- Uses CMake for local builds.
- Includes GitHub Actions CI, Dependabot, and contributor guidance at the repository level.
- Includes a `typos.toml` configuration so spelling checks can run locally and in CI.
- Install [`typos`](https://github.com/crate-ci/typos) locally if you want `just spellcheck`, `just check`, or `just pre-commit` to pass.
